   "texto": [
    "To order, you can say **Kawę poproszę**: **kawa** changes to **kawę**. We also say **Wodę, proszę**; **woda** changes to **wodę**.",
    "To order tea: **herbatę**. They are forms of the direct object, although Spanish does not change the word."
   ]
